er. If you have a specific concern about the expiry or batch before purchasing, contact us and we can help verify the available product information.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_byGTwh"]},"accordion_row_nVq3jw":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"What if the product does not suit my skin or hair?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_mjn7PA":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Stop using the product if you experience irritation, discomfort or an unexpected reaction. Beauty and personal-care products may not work identically for every person, so we recommend checking the ingredients and intended use before purchasing. Because these are personal-use products, a product simply not suiting an individual is different from receiving a damaged, defective or incorrect item.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_mjn7PA"]},"accordion_row_6EJBPJ":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"What should I do if I receive a damaged, leaking or wrong product?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_Y4mU9k":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Contact us as soon as possible after receiving your order and provide your order number along with clear photos or videos of the product, packaging and issue. We will review the case and help resolve verified damaged, defective or incorrect-order issues according to our return policy.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_Y4mU9k"]},"accordion_row_tQ34aR":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I open the parcel before paying the courier?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_HLY6Xr":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Whether a parcel can be opened before payment depends on the courier's delivery policy. Customers should not assume that every shipment can be opened before payment. If you have concerns about your order, contact us and we will help resolve the issue according to our applicable policy.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_HLY6Xr"]},"accordion_row_e4tLxV":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Do you deliver beauty products all over Pakistan?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_T8KibJ":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Yes. We offer nationwide delivery across Pakistan, including major cities and other serviceable areas. Delivery time may vary depending on your location and courier coverage.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_T8KibJ"]},"accordion_row_UMxbG6":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"How long does delivery take in Pakistan?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_deeC3G":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Orders are normally processed promptly after confirmation and are generally delivered within 2–3 business days after dispatch. Delivery time can vary depending on your location, courier operations, weather and remote-area coverage. Tracking details are shared after dispatch when available.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_deeC3G"]},"accordion_row_LR7XVi":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Do you offer Cash on Delivery (COD) in Pakistan?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_UkrzeN":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Yes. Cash on Delivery is available for eligible orders across Pakistan. You can place your order online and pay when your parcel is delivered.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_UkrzeN"]},"accordion_row_yDPBJY":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"What is the price of this product in Pakistan?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_4Eg36Y":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>The current price is displayed directly on this product page in Pakistani Rupees (PKR). Product prices and promotional offers may change, so the price shown at the time you place your order is the applicable price.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_4Eg36Y"]},"accordion_row_pgNhLE":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Is this product suitable for Pakistan's weather?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_RgGpb3":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Many beauty products can be used throughout Pakistan, but your routine may need to change with the weather. Hot and humid conditions can increase sweating and surface oil, while dry winter weather can increase moisture loss. Choose lighter formulas when appropriate for hot weather and richer moisturising products when your skin or hair needs additional hydration.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_RgGpb3"]},"accordion_row_RwJzUN":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I use this product if I have sensitive skin?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_9cPqwx":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Some products are suitable for sensitive skin and others may contain ingredients that are not appropriate for everyone. Always check the ingredients and product description before use. If you have a known allergy or sensitivity, avoid ingredients that trigger you and consider performing a patch test when appropriate.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_9cPqwx"]},"accordion_row_yBLUw3":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"How long does it take to see results?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_UKnXyW":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Results vary depending on the product, your skin or hair type, how consistently you use it and the concern being addressed. Some products provide an immediate cosmetic effect, such as softness, shine or hydration, while products targeting concerns such as uneven tone, dryness or hair damage may require consistent use over time. Follow the product instructions and avoid expecting overnight results from treatment-focused products.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_UKnXyW"]},"accordion_row_GaEKzg":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"How should I use this product?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_RmLdkh":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Usage instructions are provided in the product description whenever available. Follow the recommended amount, frequency and application method for the specific product. Do not use a product differently from its intended purpose. For skincare products, introduce new active ingredients gradually if your skin is sensitive.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_RmLdkh"]},"accordion_row_GWQRR3":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Is this product 100% original and authentic?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_4mrPTb":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Yes. Aslam Beauty sells 100% authentic beauty and personal-care products sourced through trusted supply channels. We have been working in the beauty and cosmetics industry for decades and maintain a physical store, warehouse and distribution presence in Pakistan. We do not sell replicas, first copies, diluted products or repackaged stock.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_4mrPTb"]},"accordion_row_rydVDa":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"How can I know if this beauty product is genuine?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_Yj6hye":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>You can check the product packaging, brand details, batch information and other identifying information when your order arrives. We source our products through established suppliers and distribution channels and take authenticity seriously. If you have a specific concern about a product before ordering, contact us and our team can help.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_Yj6hye"]},"accordion_row_taGcTg":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Is this product suitable for my skin type, hair type or specific concern?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_Kh4Lhj":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>It depends on the individual product. Check the product description, highlighted benefits, ingredients and usage instructions before purchasing. We clearly explain what each product is designed to help with, such as dry skin, oily skin, acne-prone skin, dark spots, damaged hair, frizz, dryness or everyday hydration. If you are unsure, contact us before ordering and we can help you choose.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_Kh4Lhj"]},"accordion_row_WzJQH4":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"How do I choose the right skincare product for my skin type?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"question_mark","width":20},"blocks":{"text_jQthBy":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Start with your main skin concern rather than choosing a product only because it is popular. Oily skin may need lightweight, non-heavy formulas, while dry skin generally benefits from more moisturising products. Sensitive skin usually requires simpler and gentler formulas. Always check the individual product's ingredients, intended use and suitability before purchasing.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_jQthBy"]},"accordion_row_exUCEn":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"W